alarm-notification-simulator/source/

# 部署筆記檔：內含正式環境密鑰／示範帳密，絕不可發佈成網頁。
# 這裡與根目錄 .gitignore 是兩道獨立的防線：.gitignore 擋「進不進 git」，
# 這份擋「有沒有被當成網站資產發佈」。兩者都要有。
# Deployment scratch notes holding live secrets / demo credentials. This and
# the root .gitignore are two independent barriers: .gitignore controls what
# enters git, this controls what gets served as a site asset. Keep both.
alarm-notification-simulator/render installation guide.txt
alarm-notification-simulator/手機密碼.txt

# Travel-Assistance：網站只需要 index.html（與其副本 prototype.html）；其餘為文件、後端原始碼、
# 知識庫、測試與開發筆記，不應被當成網頁公開。2026-09-23 部署檢查時發現 README.md、PROMPT.md、
# backend/main.py、知識庫 JSON、.env.example、git_push_commands.md 皆可被任何人讀取（HTTP 200）。
# Travel-Assistance: the site needs only index.html (and its copy prototype.html). Everything else is docs,
# backend source, KB data, tests and dev notes. The 2026-09-23 deployment check found README.md, PROMPT.md,
# backend/main.py, KB JSON, .env.example and git_push_commands.md publicly readable (HTTP 200).
Travel-Assistance/*.md
Travel-Assistance/*.docx
Travel-Assistance/*.xlsx
Travel-Assistance/*.txt
Travel-Assistance/*.json
Travel-Assistance/*.py
Travel-Assistance/*.js
Travel-Assistance/.env*
Travel-Assistance/.gitignore
Travel-Assistance/backend/
Travel-Assistance/frontend/
Travel-Assistance/integrations/
Travel-Assistance/mcp_servers/
Travel-Assistance/poc/
Travel-Assistance/requirement/
Travel-Assistance/scratch/
Travel-Assistance/tools/
Travel-Assistance/__pycache__/
Travel-Assistance/.pytest_cache/
Travel-Assistance/.travel-state/

# Worker 原始碼與設定（Phase 1，2026-09-23）：程式碼由 Worker 執行，不需也不應再以靜態檔案公開。
# 部署檢查時發現 Cloudflare 自動產生的 wrangler.jsonc 與 render.yaml 皆可被任何人讀取（HTTP 200）。
# Worker source and config (Phase 1, 2026-09-23): the code runs as the Worker and must not also be
# served as a static file. The deployment check found the auto-generated wrangler.jsonc and
# render.yaml publicly readable (HTTP 200).
worker/
wrangler.jsonc
.wrangler/
.dev.vars*

# 根目錄 .env（2026-09-24 補）：assets.directory = "." 讓整個 repo 根成為資產目錄，
# 而 Wrangler 預設不忽略 dotfile —— 上方 L57-60 記載的 /.git/config HTTP 200 就是證據。
# .env 未進 git，所以 git-connected build 不會發佈它；但本機執行一次
# wrangler deploy 就會把它整包上傳。這行是那個情境下唯一的防線。
# Root .env (added 2026-09-24): the repo root IS the asset directory and Wrangler does
# not ignore dotfiles by default (see the /.git/config finding above). .env is untracked,
# so a git-connected build never publishes it — but a local `wrangler deploy` uploads the
# working directory as-is. This line is the only guard in that case.
.env
.env.*
!/.env.example

# 內部文件（2026-09-24 補）：缺陷登記簿與強化計畫。*.md 已被下方全域規則排除，
# 這裡明確列出 —— 靠別條規則順便擋住不是保護，是巧合。
# Internal docs: already covered by the blanket *.md rule below, but listed explicitly
# because being caught by an unrelated rule is a coincidence, not a control.
DEFECTS.md
PLAN_*.md
render.yaml

# 根目錄開發用腳本：2026-09-23 發現 tools/patch_frontend_dynamic_ai.py 內含寫死的 NVIDIA 金鑰，
# 且可從 st8925lab.com/tools/ 公開下載。網站頁面沒有引用 tools/ 下的任何檔案。
# Root dev scripts: on 2026-09-23 tools/patch_frontend_dynamic_ai.py was found to contain a
# hardcoded NVIDIA key, downloadable from st8925lab.com/tools/. No page references tools/.
tools/

# Git 中繼資料：Cloudflare 建置時的 clone 含 .git，2026-09-23 發現 /.git/config、/.git/HEAD 可被讀取（HTTP 200）。
# Git metadata: the Cloudflare build clone contains .git; /.git/config and /.git/HEAD were found
# publicly readable (HTTP 200) on 2026-09-23.
.git

# Superseded artifacts: kept in the repo as history, but never published.
# (V4/, project.html and V4_prompt.md used to be listed here too; Sam had
# them deleted outright on 2026-08-14, so they no longer need excluding.)
# 已被取代的產物：保留在 repo 內作為歷史，但不對外發佈。
prompt_init.md
SPEC-v4.md
ST8925-LAB-standalone.html
st8925lab-deploy-guide.html

# ==========================================================================
# 2026-09-24 全站盤點：2026-09-23 那次只補了 Travel-Assistance／worker／tools／
# cloudmd，其餘子專案遺漏。實測以下路徑當時皆可被任何人下載（HTTP 200）：
# VPS_DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md（內含 production .env 範本）、README.md、PROMPT.md、
# walkthrough.md、st-development-skill.md、log_20260818_01.txt、.agentMemory/*.md、
# .claude/settings.local.json、ai-diagnostic-kb/source/backend/**、
# iot-gen2-simulator-monitor/vps/**、各子專案 README.md 與 PROMPT.md。
# 2026-09-24 site-wide audit: the 2026-09-23 pass covered only Travel-Assistance,
# worker/, tools/ and cloudmd/. Every path above was confirmed publicly
# downloadable (HTTP 200) before these rules were added.
#
# 限制（重要）：這份檔案只擋「是否被當成靜態資產發佈」，擋不住 GitHub。本 repo 在
# GitHub 是 public，所以這些檔案在 github.com/Steven8925/st8925lab 仍然看得到。
# 它降低曝光面，但不是移除機密的工具 —— 真的外洩必須更換金鑰本身。
# Limitation: this only stops asset publishing, NOT GitHub. The repo is public, so
# these files stay visible there. This reduces exposure surface but never removes a
# secret; a real leak must be fixed by rotating the credential itself.
#
# 已逐一確認網站實際引用的檔案（index.html／app.js／config.js／geodata.js／shared/，
# 以及 ai-diagnostic-kb、iot-gen2-simulator-monitor、alarm-notification-simulator、
# project-04、project-05 的 index.html＋app.js＋style.css＋modules/＋assets/）
# 都不引用任何 .md／.py／.txt／.sql／.yml，故下列全域型別規則不會破壞網站。
# Verified: no served page references .md/.py/.txt/.sql/.yml, so the blanket type
# rules below cannot break the site.
# ==========================================================================

# 文件類：開發歷程、重建規格、計畫、任務與筆記。用全域規則，讓「未來新增的子專案」
# 預設就不會外洩，不必每次記得補。
# Docs: dev history, rebuild specs, plans, tasks, notes. Blanket rules so future
# subprojects are private by default instead of relying on memory.
*.md
*.txt

# 例外：僅限「根目錄」的 SEO 檔案（目前不存在，先留規則避免日後新增時被 *.txt 擋掉）。
# 前面的 / 是必要的：未加錨點的 !robots.txt 會連 cloudmd/option_C/public/robots.txt
# 一起重新納入，破壞 cloudmd/ 的整層排除。2026-09-24 驗證時發現並修正。
# Root-only SEO exceptions. The leading / is required: an unanchored !robots.txt
# also re-includes cloudmd/option_C/public/robots.txt, defeating the cloudmd/
# directory exclusion. Caught during verification on 2026-09-24.
!/robots.txt
!/llms.txt

# Windows 與下載殘留（2026-09-24 由 tools/check_public_surface.py 首次執行時抓到）：
# $RECYCLE.BIN 就在 repo 根目錄，assets.directory="." 會把它當靜態資產發佈 ——
# 等於把刪除的檔案放到網站上。V4/ 內是一個 Google Drive 下載壓縮檔。
# 只排除、不刪除：刪除屬受管制動作，需山姆哥個別授權。
# Windows and download residue, caught by the first run of the surface checker.
# $RECYCLE.BIN sits in the repo root and would be served as static assets, i.e.
# deleted files published to the web. Excluded, not deleted.
$RECYCLE.BIN/
V4/
desktop.ini

# 開發腳本與後端 Python 原始碼（根目錄 verify.py／make_standalone.py 等）。
# Dev scripts and backend Python source (root verify.py / make_standalone.py etc).
*.py

# 子專案後端與基礎設施原始碼：Dockerfile、SQL、PHP、nginx 設定、docker-compose、
# .env.example 等，全部由伺服器端執行，不應以靜態檔案公開。
# Subproject backend and infra source: Dockerfiles, SQL, PHP, nginx config,
# docker-compose, .env.example. All server-side; never served as static files.
ai-diagnostic-kb/source/
iot-gen2-simulator-monitor/vps/

# 內部 agent 記憶與本機工具設定。.claude/settings.local.json 於 2026-09-24
# 一併以 git rm --cached 停止追蹤。
# Internal agent memory and local tooling config. settings.local.json was also
# untracked via git rm --cached on 2026-09-24.
.agentMemory/
.claude/

# 版控與發佈設定本身不需要公開。
# VCS and publish configuration need not be public.
.gitignore
.assetsignore
.gitmodules

# CI 工作流（2026-09-24）：.github/ 是 dotfile 目錄，Wrangler 預設不忽略 dotfile，
# 所以不排除的話 checks.yml 會被當靜態資產發佈。新增工作流當下，
# tools/check_public_surface.py 在型別黑名單與快照比對兩處同時報警。
# CI workflows: .github/ is a dotfile directory and Wrangler does not ignore
# dotfiles, so without this the workflow file would be served publicly.
.github/
